cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "disslucc"
abstract: >-
  Land use and land cover change (LUCC) modeling, raster-only,
  script-first, on top of dissmodel. Unified port of
  disslucc-continuous (continuous CLUE) and disslucc-discrete
  (discrete CLUE-S), validated against the original TerraME
  reference on real data.
authors:
